From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thinh Nguyen <Thinh.Nguyen@synopsys.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 00:38:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 27/30] usb: dwc3: gadget: Reset endpoint flags on controller
 start

The flags of a disabled endpoint may be preserved while its End
Transfer command is pending. If the command never completes, the stale
flags persist across a soft disconnect or an error recovery, and the
endpoint can't be used again.

Reset the flags of all non-control endpoints when starting the
controller.

Fixes: 76bff31c7fba ("usb: dwc3: gadget: Do not clear ep delayed stop flag during ep disable")
Cc: stable <stable@kernel.org>
Signed-off-by: Thinh Nguyen <Thinh.Nguyen@synopsys.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/21cd189962b9d32a4f9df381df4947d35341d5a9.1792542945.git.Thinh.Nguyen@synopsys.com
Signed-off-by: Greg Kroah-Hartman <gregkh@linuxfoundation.org>

[mzak: picked from linux-next 7c9bc134 (Thinh Nguyen's End Transfer series) for q91j, gains #30 (gadget path only; dwc3-qcom and its interconnect votes untouched); applies on this tree]

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/usb/dwc3/gadget.c | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/usb/dwc3/gadget.c b/drivers/usb/dwc3/gadget.c
index cad62d8ba..33fa32fd2 100644
--- a/drivers/usb/dwc3/gadget.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/dwc3/gadget.c
@@ -2972,6 +2972,7 @@ static int __dwc3_gadget_start(struct dwc3 *dwc)
 {
 	struct dwc3_ep		*dep;
 	int			ret = 0;
+	u32			epnum;
 	u32			reg;
 
 	/*
@@ -3029,6 +3030,15 @@ static int __dwc3_gadget_start(struct dwc3 *dwc)
 		return ret;
 	}
 
+	for (epnum = 2; epnum < dwc->num_eps; epnum++) {
+		dep = dwc->eps[epnum];
+		if (!dep)
+			continue;
+
+		dep->flags &= (DWC3_EP_TXFIFO_RESIZED |
+			       DWC3_EP_RESOURCE_ALLOCATED);
+	}
+
 	dep = dwc->eps[0];
 	dep->flags = 0;
 	ret = __dwc3_gadget_ep_enable(dep, DWC3_DEPCFG_ACTION_INIT);
-- 
